  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 10 - 4 + 13 ÷ 15 × 3 = 71 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and × \n\n10 - 4 + 13 ÷ 15 × 3 = 71 ⇒ 10 - 4 × **13 ÷ 15**__ + 3 = 71\n\n10 - __**4 **____**×**____** **__**__0.87__** + 3 = 71 \n\n__**10 + 3**__ - 3.48 = 71\n\n__**13 **____**- 3.48**__ = 71\n\n9.52 ≠ 71 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : - and ÷ \n\n10 - 4 + 13 ÷ 15 × 3 = 71 ⇒ **10 ÷ 4**__ + 13 - 15 × 3 = 71\n\n2.5 + 13 - __**15 × 3**__ = 71\n\n__**2.5 + 13**__ - 45 = 71\n\n15.5 - 45 = 71\n\n29.5 ≠ 71 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and × \n\n10 - 4 + 13 ÷ 15 × 3 = 71 ⇒ 10 - 4 + 13 × **15 ÷ 3**__ = 71\n\n10 - 4 + __**13 **____**× 5**__ = 71\n\n__**10 + 65**__ - 4 = 71\n\n__**75 - 4**__ = 71\n\n**71 = 71 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : - and ×\n\n10 - 4 + 13 ÷ 15 × 3 = 71 ⇒ 10 × 4 + **13 ÷ 15**__ - 3 = 71\n\n__**10 × 4**__ + 0.87 - 3 = 71 \n\n__**40 + 0.87**__ - 3 = 71\n\n40.87 - 3 = 71\n\n37.87 ≠ 71 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
